{
  "name": "06 · AI Inbox Triage → Labels, Drafts, Lead Capture",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inbox zero on autopilot\nEvery new unread email:\n- Claude classifies category + urgency + summary\n- Applies your Gmail labels (put label IDs in Config)\n- **Needs reply** → a reply draft sits in the thread, ready to edit & send\n- **New lead** → forwarded to workflow 01 (scored, replied, CRM'd)\n- **Known lead replying** → Leads stage = `replied` (stops workflow 02)\n- Newsletters/notifications → marked read\n- Urgent → alert email\n- Everything logged to **InboxLog**\n\nFind label IDs: run a Gmail node → *Label → Get Many*.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4abb0f08-2417-4e84-99ce-8ff7b83f9308",
      "name": "About",
